            `P[0][3]` for `t23 t18 t9 t15`
            `k=1`: `P[0][1]`={NT23,NT26,NT27}, `P[1][3]`={S}
                No productions from S. Result {}.
            `k=2`: `P[0][2]`={NT1}, `P[2][2]`={S}
                No productions from S. Result {}.
            `k=3`: `P[0][3]` for `w_1 w_2 w_3`, so `P[0][3]` for `t23 t18 t9` `w_4` (`P[0][3]` in my notation is P[s][l], so l is 3, s is 0. So this is P[0][2] in my first notation. The old P[0][3] for `t23 t18 t9 t15` is P[0][4])
