    *   P[3][3] (`t9 t8 t23`):
        *   k=1: (P[3][1], P[4][2]) = ({NT26, NT7, NT19, NT11, NT14, NT25}, {NT26})
            *   NT2 -> NT19 NT26 (from (NT19, NT26)) => {NT2}
